<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"> Dynamics of Linear Systems 
<br class="ltx_break">over Finite Commutative Rings<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>* Corresponding author. Email: ymzou@uwm.edu</span></span></span></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
